# Taster of Wares: "you may cast it for as long as you control this creature" (CR 611.2a, 611.2b). Bot2's Taster exiles Bot1's
# Lightning Bolt. The permission belongs to Bot2 while Bot2 controls the Taster: when Bot1 takes the Taster with Act of Treason,
# Bot2 no longer controls it and Bot1, who never was "you", doesn't either, so Bot1 may not cast its own exiled Bolt even with
# the Mox Ruby's mana open. The duration has ended for good: when the Taster goes back to Bot2 at end of turn, Bot2 may not cast
# it either, though Bot2 has an Island's mana open.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Lightning Bolt
Act of Treason
Mox Ruby
Mountain x30

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Taster of Wares
Island x30

[Actions]
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: B)
Bot2.Hand.Taster of Wares.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
Bot2.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
? Exile = Lightning Bolt
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: R)
Bot1.Hand.Act of Treason.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Taster of Wares)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Taster of Wares.Types = Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
! Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Island.Activate
! Bot2.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)

[Expect]
Exile = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot2.Life = 20
